Sean's Wallpaper Archive - licensing scope

Wallpaper images and other artwork
----------------------------------

Copyright in the wallpaper images and other artwork, including image previews
in docs/, remains with the original creators and respective rights holders.
These images are not licensed under the Apache License by this repository.

The original license or permission terms are unknown for most images in this
archive. Inclusion in the archive does not grant any additional rights to use,
modify, or redistribute an image. Where an original license or permission is
known, its terms apply. Unknown licensing must not be treated as public domain
or permission to reuse.

Original photography by Sean Galie
----------------------------------

The photographs by Sean Galie listed in LICENSE-ORIGINALS, currently the six
images in wallpapers/desktops/original/, are licensed under the Creative
Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International License. LICENSE-ORIGINALS
lists the covered images and contains the full license text. They may be shared
and adapted for non-commercial purposes with credit to Sean Galie.

Corrections to source credits or licensing information, and requests from
rights holders, can be submitted through the repository's GitHub issues:
https://github.com/seangalie/wallpapers/issues
Please include the image path and any relevant original source or terms.

